1
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:15,430
It's you

2
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,270
who framed my father.

3
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,050
Mr. Qin, you arrived

4
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,370
a bit later than I expected.

5
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:22,930
Stop playing dumb.

6
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,800
It was you

7
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,680
who caused the crash yesterday.

8
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,320
Breaking news today:

9
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,520
Mr. Qin Shan,

10
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,070
a front-runner in the mayoral election,

11
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,710
unfortunately suffered
a car accident last night

12
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:41,750
and was severely injured.

13
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:43,030
After the police intervened,

14
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:45,130
it turned out that
Qin Shan had taken bribes in the election.

15
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:47,280
Now Qin Shan is
under police investigation.

16
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,110
The Xinji's Development Project
he was in charge of

17
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,240
has been taken over by his son, Qin Yue.

18
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:56,710
Now,

19
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:59,200
do you still want to kill me?

20
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,610
You did all this.

21
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,600
Don't tell me

22
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:15,260
you expect me to repay you?

23
00:01:28,220 --> 00:01:29,810
Mom, you dressed like that

24
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,530
for hanging out
with your girlfriends again?

25
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,000
What's it to you?

26
00:01:34,950 --> 00:01:37,620
Or do you want to get close to me?

27
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,640
Come along, then.

28
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:39,830
Good.

29
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:43,120
I have a lot to say to you, Mom.

30
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,310
[Dearest Episode 7]

31
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:55,640
Mr. Qin suddenly withdrew from
Xinji's development.

32
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:57,120
What a pity.

33
00:01:59,490 --> 00:02:01,150
The election is approaching.

34
00:02:01,150 --> 00:02:03,410
I need to fulfill my father's wish first.

35
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:06,810
and find a new owner for Xinji.

36
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,840
By doing this, I won't let my father down

37
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:11,960
and can make friends with Mr. He.

38
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,960
Thanks for your trust, Mr. Qin.

39
00:02:17,190 --> 00:02:18,560
To Mr. Qin Shan.

40
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,430
But I'm curious,

41
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:25,560
why did Mr. Qin

42
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:28,520
ask to meet me at Cloudsea Club?

43
00:02:30,170 --> 00:02:32,970
Talking business in an entertainment venue

44
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:36,190
seems absurd, but safe actually.

45
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,079
I've always heard Cloudsea Club

46
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:40,840
is a place for indulgence,

47
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,280
but seeing it today,

48
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:44,710
it's truly beyond expectation.

49
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,400
What Mr. He sees here

50
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:50,090
is just the tip of
the iceberg.

51
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,520
Countless businessmen in this city

52
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,910
come here to unwind.

53
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,800
They shed their masks,

54
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,910
exchange toasts here,

55
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:02,500
watch the scene,
and scheme in the shadows.

56
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:05,280
But you should know that
those who can play here

57
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,840
are never truly drunk.

58
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,120
An accident,

59
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:14,420
an encounter,

60
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:17,180
can leverage a project worth billions

61
00:03:17,329 --> 00:03:19,260
and determine the layout of a city.

62
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:22,800
The one who can orchestrate
such a big game

63
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:24,430
is the real key figure.

64
00:03:25,150 --> 00:03:27,190
The same goes for Xinji's land.

65
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,960
The real owner of it

66
00:03:29,170 --> 00:03:31,800
is Alex, the Boss of Cloudsea Club.

67
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:35,590
I've long heard of

68
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:37,680
how resourceful he is.

69
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,010
I've heard of it before.

70
00:03:40,710 --> 00:03:43,120
I heard

71
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,520
he made the connection to
jointly develop Xingji's prime location

72
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:47,190
with Minister Zhou of the
Resources Bureau.

73
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:49,190
Outsiders who want in

74
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,750
must work with him.

75
00:03:53,079 --> 00:03:55,960
Mr. Qin, if you'd be willing to help me

76
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:59,190
get in touch with Mr. Alex,

77
00:03:59,540 --> 00:04:02,190
I'll repay you double when it's done.

78
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:12,200
Since Mr. He is so sincere,

79
00:04:12,610 --> 00:04:14,080
I'll get straight to the point.

80
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,280
Tonight's meeting

81
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,310
is meant to

82
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:18,970
bridge the connection
between you and Mr. Alex.

83
00:04:19,459 --> 00:04:20,070
Let's go.

84
00:04:20,350 --> 00:04:22,360
Mr. Alex has been waiting for a long time.

85
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:22,950
Okay.

86
00:04:25,550 --> 00:04:27,040
Okay. Thank you, Mr. Qin.

87
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:28,660
Come, please.

88
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:37,659
Mr. He, this is the Tinghai Suite.

89
00:04:38,570 --> 00:04:39,810
Alex is inside.

90
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:44,159
Let's go.

91
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:45,700
Please.

92
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:49,290
If you like it, I'll give it to you.

93
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:50,770
It doesn't suit me.

94
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,080
The big one.

95
00:04:57,240 --> 00:05:00,190
Honey, why are you here?

96
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:02,510
This is Mrs. Wen.

97
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:05,200
There must be a mistake.

98
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:07,950
What, you're here to have fun too?

99
00:05:08,430 --> 00:05:09,390
Or

100
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:11,810
are you going to introduce

101
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:14,030
the handsome guy next to you?

102
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:20,490
Mr. He, I'll wait for you outside.

103
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:21,700
Mr. Qin.

104
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:26,380
Honey, don't go.

105
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:29,100
Shouldn't you explain to me

106
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,960
why you are here?

107
00:05:33,750 --> 00:05:36,560
He Mu, you are so dirty.

108
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:39,870
I'm dirty?

109
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:41,310
Dirty thing!

110
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,270
Dirty thing! I'll wash you clean!

111
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:44,600
How can you be laughing?

112
00:05:46,190 --> 00:05:47,670
Xin, I'll protect you!

113
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:52,480
You slept with my wife
and you dare to hit me?

114
00:05:52,710 --> 00:05:54,220
You dirty thing!

115
00:05:55,630 --> 00:05:56,310
Mr. Qin!

116
00:05:57,050 --> 00:05:58,050
Goodbye. Mr. Qin!

117
00:05:58,830 --> 00:05:59,360
Mr. Qin!

118
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,070
Sir, sir, sir!

119
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,880
Mr. Qin has already gone.

120
00:06:02,970 --> 00:06:04,100
How dare you stop me?

121
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:11,410
You're just a watchdog!

122
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,000
Dirty thing,

123
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,800
how dare you touch me?

124
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:28,040
Eat it. Eat it!

125
00:06:30,010 --> 00:06:32,300
You dirty dog, let me clean you up!

126
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,040
Call for help.

127
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,430
Go save him.

128
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,360
Let me wash you clean!

129
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,800
I'll wash you clean!

130
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,600
You dog!

131
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,730
Take your hands off!

132
00:06:48,990 --> 00:06:50,790
Let me go! You dog!

133
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:52,240
Let me go!

134
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:55,000
He really hasn't changed,

135
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:58,170
still so good at
kissing up and kicking down.

136
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,600
Since he loves to bully so much,

137
00:07:00,930 --> 00:07:02,440
let's show him

138
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,530
the consequences.

139
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:05,450
Step two,

140
00:07:06,140 --> 00:07:09,060
make him stand before
the one he used to bully

141
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:11,210
and make him feel ashamed.

142
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:28,160
I must get that land of Xinji.

143
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:32,120
Grandpa personally promised

144
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,120
that as long as I can get

145
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,870
the development rights for it,

146
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:37,020
he will let me return to the group.

147
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:40,510
Whether I can return to
my original position

148
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:42,000
depends on this time.

149
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:45,150
He Mu is determined to
get the development rights

150
00:07:45,180 --> 00:07:47,540
to take the position of executive director

151
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:49,740
and completely control Wenshan Group.

152
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,630
Then I'll let him watch

153
00:07:53,220 --> 00:07:56,590
how this position returns to my hands.

154
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,510
So no matter the cost,

155
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:01,560
I must win.

156
00:08:17,470 --> 00:08:19,150
We won't let her win, right?

157
00:08:21,830 --> 00:08:22,430
Of course.

158
00:08:22,750 --> 00:08:23,880
Trying to vie with me

159
00:08:24,530 --> 00:08:25,610
won't be that easy.

160
00:08:36,659 --> 00:08:38,080
Chairman He, please have a seat.

161
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,740
The boss will be here shortly.

162
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,760
Mr. Alex, I've heard so much about you.
